      "guid": null,
      "name": "Disable Seasonal Events",
      "slug": "disable-seasonal-events",
      "teaser": "Simple mod to disable seasonal event detection.\r\nAffects New Years, Christmas, Halloween events.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2440.png",
      "downloads": 15678,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p>- Install Instructions</p>\n<p>Drag and drop the user folder into your SPT game folder</p>\n<p>This a simple mod so it shouldn’t conflict with anything (hopefully)</p>\n<p>For reference, these are the Vanilla SPT 3.11.2 dates for seasonal events (based on your computer’s clock)</p>\n<p>In SPT 3.11.2, the ending dates are inclusive, rather than exclusive. So the event will end the day after the end date.</p>\n<p>HalloweenChristmasNew Years<br />\nChristmas JanuaryApril Fools<br />\nStart Date28 October<br />\n12 December<br />\n1 January<br />\n2 January1 April<br />\nEnd Date<br />\n9 November<br />\n31 December<br />\n1 January<br />\n14 January2 April</p>\n<h3>NOTE: This does not affect seasons (snow on the ground/raining), I suggest <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2118-simple-season-selector/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Simple Season Selector</a> for that.</h3>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1799/disable-seasonal-events",
